{"id":"vod_md_3655","vodId":"3655","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"野良神","name_cn":"野良神","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230829-1/8fd67eadea292f548ed9009889cac629.jpg"},"summary":"夜斗（神谷浩史 配音），是个居无定所、打着散工、穿着运动服的落魄神明，既没有神社供奉，连手下的神器也急着跳槽，他却怀着“受万民景仰”的伟大梦想，以五元香油钱为价格，接受各种各样的委托，上至砍妖除魔，下至打扫卫生。就这样，夜斗穿梭于此岸与彼岸，与八百万神明、服侍神明的“神器”、人类以及妖，共同生活在这个光怪陆离的世界中。一天，普通初中女生一岐日和（内田真礼 配音）因意外与夜斗结缘，为此落下了一种奇怪的体质——灵魂和身体很容易出现分离。日和拜托夜斗解决自己的问题，夜斗却烦恼着自己手下没有“神器”。不久，夜斗命中注定的神器出现了，夜斗赐其名为雪音（梶裕贵 配音）……本动画改编自安达渡嘉创作的同名神幻题材漫画。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-29 01:07:36","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/XFIhppfe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/bAoc72Q6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/zViTq7iB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/obPkBeec/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/wxK5gZqi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/1jkN69Pg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/pHoeeMMk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/Ju7vsWXS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/WOZhvn7A/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/luaNTo6s/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/6UBDAGT2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/POoruROl/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:42.499Z"}